-- {uses: [4, 5]} --
(6) [The prorogation was null and of no effect]: The prorogation itself was unlawful, null and of no effect.
    {fidelity: "paraphrase", pinpoint: "[69]", source: "\"It too was unlawful, null and of no effect.\""}
